        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled in the highly regarded Woodstock area on the outskirts of Ennis, this property enjoys a superb setting that perfectly balances countryside tranquility with everyday convenience. \r\nWoodstock is a sought-after residential location, renowned for its peaceful surroundings, attractive rural character, and excellent accessibility. Residents benefit from a serene environment while remaining within easy reach of all the amenities and services that Ennis has to offer. \r\nEnnis town centre is just a short drive away, providing access to a wide range of excellent schools, shopping facilities, restaurants, cafés, sporting clubs, and leisure amenities. The area is particularly appealing to families and commuters alike, offering a relaxed lifestyle without compromising on connectivity. \r\nThe location also benefits from excellent transport links, with convenient access to the M18 motorway, making commuting to Shannon, Limerick, Galway, and beyond both straightforward and efficient. The renowned Woodstock Golf Club is nearby, while scenic countryside walks and a variety of recreational amenities further enhance the appeal of this desirable address. \r\nCombining a peaceful rural setting with exceptional convenience, Woodstock is widely regarded as one of the most attractive and desirable residential locations in the Ennis area. \r\n\r\n\r\nNestled in the highly regarded Woodstock area on the outskirts of Ennis, this property enjoys a superb setting that perfectly balances countryside tranquility with everyday convenience. \r\nWoodstock is a sought-after residential location, renowned for its peaceful surroundings, attractive rural character, and excellent accessibility. Residents benefit from a serene environment while remaining within easy reach of all the amenities and services that Ennis has to offer. \r\nEnnis town centre is just a short drive away, providing access to a wide range of excellent schools, shopping facilities, restaurants, cafés, sporting clubs, and leisure amenities. The area is particularly appealing to families and commuters alike, offering a relaxed lifestyle without compromising on connectivity. \r\nThe location also benefits from excellent transport links, with convenient access to the M18 motorway, making commuting to Shannon, Limerick, Galway, and beyond both straightforward and efficient. The renowned Woodstock Golf Club is nearby, while scenic countryside walks and a variety of recreational amenities further enhance the appeal of this desirable address. \r\nCombining a peaceful rural setting with exceptional convenience, Woodstock is widely regarded as one of the most attractive and desirable residential locations in the Ennis area. \r\n\r\nServices:\r\nG.F.C.H - Underfloor to ground floor, radiators to first floor, mains water, septic tank, electricity. \r\n\r\nBER: B (Can be upgrated to A with air to water and/or solar panels)\r\n\r\nAsking Price: \r\n\r\nOffers in the Region €850,000"
      },
